Package: clingo-lpx
Architecture: any
Section: devel
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libclingo-lpx (= ${binary:Version})
Description: A solver for logic programs with linear constraints
 Clingo-lpx is an extension of the clingo answer set programming system that
 integrates linear constraint solving. It enables modeling and solving problems
 with variables over rationals, making it suitable for applications such as
 resource allocation and planning.

Package: libclingo-lpx
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: The shared library for the clingo-lpx package

